---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Birmingham Jump Start"
  description="How Birmingham Jump Start collects, uses and protects your personal information when you call, message or use our website."
  path="privacy-policy/"
>
  <section class="hero hero-slim" id="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow rv"><span class="dot"></span>Legal</span>
      <h1 class="rv rv-d1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="sub rv rv-d2">Last updated: 15 October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="legal rv">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>Birmingham Jump Start is the 24/7 jump start and vehicle recovery service of Alliedzone Recovery Ltd, operating across Birmingham and the West Midlands. This policy explains what personal information we collect and how we use it.</p>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>When you call or message us, we collect your phone number, your location, and details of the vehicle problem so we can send help. If you browse this website, we collect basic anonymous usage data such as pages visited. We do not collect payment card details on this website.</p>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>We use your information to provide the service you asked for: dispatching a technician, giving you an arrival time, and contacting you about your job. We may also use it to improve our service and to meet legal obligations.</p>
        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>We share your location and contact details with the technician assigned to your job. We do not sell your personal information to anyone, and we do not share it for marketing by third parties.</p>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>We keep job records for as long as needed to run the business and meet tax and legal requirements, then delete them securely.</p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. To do any of these, call 07477 649906 and we will help.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this policy, call us on 07477 649906 any time.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
